e><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-ink">The salesperson moved on without exploring the concern.</p></li></ul><p class="mt-3 rounded-md bg-warn-soft px-3 py-2 text-xs text-warn">Approved Objection Doc not yet available; accuracy of responses needs human verification.</p></div></div></section><div class="pointer-events-none fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-[110] flex w-[min(360px,calc(100vw-2rem))] flex-col gap-2" aria-live="polite"></div>"`;

