oke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg>YES Mode (22%): the conversation moved on before this stage was explored properly.</p><div class="mt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand hover:underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-arrow-right lucide-arrow-right-circle h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m12 16 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="M8 12h8"></path></svg>Segment 27</button></div></li><li class="rounded-lg border p-3 border-warn/25 bg-warn-soft/30"><p class="flex gap-2 text-[13px] text-ink"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg>Testimonials (22%): the conversation moved on before this stage was explored properly.</p><div class="mt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand hover:underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-arrow-right lucide-arrow-right-circle h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m12 16 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="M8 12h8"></path></svg>Segment 24</button></div></li></ul></div></div></section><div class="pointer-events-none fixed bottom-4 